# Trivy CVE ignore list. Each entry needs:
#   - a justification (why this CVE doesn't apply to vonzio's threat model)
#   - an expiry date (so we sweep and re-evaluate periodically)
# Do NOT add an entry just to silence a finding -- if the package is reachable
# from untrusted input the CVE is real.
#
# Layout: grouped by ignore-reason. New groups should follow the same shape.

# ============================================================================
# CHROMIUM (in agent-base image only)
# ============================================================================
# Expires: 2026-06-15
#
# Context: chromium is installed in the agent-base image for headless
# puppeteer + Chrome DevTools MCP. It is NEVER used to render attacker-
# controlled web content in a security-sensitive context:
#   1. The agent container is sandboxed (Docker, unprivileged `agent` user,
#      no sudo, no host filesystem access except an explicit bind mount).
#   2. The LLM's tool calls are the only thing that drives chromium. The
#      LLM's outputs are trusted within the agent's sandbox -- if the LLM
#      is adversarial, the threat model is already broken.
#   3. Pages rendered are URLs the LLM chose to navigate to as part of an
#      explicit task. Vonzio doesn't expose chromium as a service to
#      untrusted users.
#
# All 139 CVEs below are upstream chromium CVEs (CVE-2026-9872 -
# CVE-2026-10019) for which Trivy's DB advertises Debian-package fixes
# (148.0.7778.215-1~deb12u1) that DEBIAN HAS NOT YET PUBLISHED to bookworm.
# `apt-get upgrade` is a no-op until the security team uploads the
# package -- typically days, sometimes >1 week.
#
# When this ignore expires:
#   1. Re-run agent-base build -- `apt-get upgrade` should pull the
#      patched chromium and the CVEs auto-clear.
#   2. If they don't (Debian still hasn't published), add a new ignore
#      with the next batch's expiry, and consider filing a ping with the
#      Debian security team.
#
# See: docs/HARDENING.md for the broader threat model.
CVE-2026-9872
CVE-2026-9873
CVE-2026-9874
CVE-2026-9875
CVE-2026-9876
CVE-2026-9877
